      "id": "haimpe",
      "name": "text-basic",
      "parent": "aphgdl",
      "children": [],
      "settings": {
        "text": "<dt>Raised spot UV</dt><dd>A little gloss where it counts. Raised spot UV adds shine and dimension to selected details: a glossy, raised finish you can see and feel.</dd>",
        "tag": "div"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ihgjcb",
      "name": "text-basic",
      "parent": "aphgdl",
      "children": [],
      "settings": {
        "text": "<dt>[Confirm] Foil</dt><dd>A metallic finish applied to selected parts of your design, so it catches the light.</dd>",
        "tag": "div"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fldoed",
      "name": "text-basic",
      "parent": "aphgdl",
      "children": [],
      "settings": {
        "text": "<dt>[Confirm] Embossing</dt><dd>A raised impression pressed into the paper, so your design can be felt as well as seen.</dd>",
        "tag": "div"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fbndoo",
      "name": "text-basic",
      "parent": "aphgdl",
      "children": [],
      "settings": {
        "text": "<dt>Paper weight</dt><dd>How thick and substantial a stock feels. Heavier stocks feel more rigid in hand and show more of their edge.</dd>",
